 Kumbhajgiri (Dharamshala Theli), at Santacruz in Mumbai, near Desai Pol Pedhi in Surat, at Jaisalmer, and at Bharuch. On the sacred hills of Shatrunjay, where two paths meet, stands a deri (small shrine) of Kalikund Parshwanath. Images of Kalikund Parshwanath are also found at Bhildiyaji Tirtha, Jiravala Tirtha, Chandanbala Apartments in Mumbai, the Shri Adinath Temple at Walkeshwar in Mumbai, and Hathibhai ni Wadi in Ahmedabad.\\\"}]\\n24:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Hymn of Praise: Taking initiation, he came to dwell in the Vanakhand forest; on the bank of a pond he stood absorbed in kayotsarga meditation; there, by means of an elephant bearing a lotus, worship was offered to Lord Parshwa — \\\\\\\"With loving devotion I bow in reverence to Shri Kalikund Parshwa...\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n25:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Chanting Mantra: \\\\\\\"Om Hreem Arham Shri Kalikund Parshwanathaya Namah\\\\\\\"\\\"}]\\n26:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"10\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Trust: Shri Kalikund Parshwanath Jain Shwetambar Tirth, c/o Shri Tejpal Vastu Jain Dharmagranth Trust, Post: Dholka – 387810, District: Ahmedabad, State: Gujarat, India. Phone: 02714-225218, 02714-225738, Mobile: 9427030982.\\\"}]\\n27:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"11\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"History of the 108 Parshwanath Dadas and how to reach them... Part 6: After completing pilgrimage to a total of 16 Parshwanath Lord shrines — 4 at Navsari, Surat and Rader; 2 at Bharuch and Gandhar; 4 at Dabhoi, Chhani and Borsad; 4 at Khambhat; and 2 at Kheda and Dholka — we will next travel to the 4 Parshwanath Lord shrines of Ahmedabad. Dholka to Ahmedabad – 40 km.\\\"}]\\n28:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"12\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"Ahmedabad: 17. Shri Shamla Parshwanath, 18. Shri Muleva Parshwanath, 19. Shri Hrikar Parshwanath, 20. Shri Sukhsagar Parshwanath.\\\"}]\\n29:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"13\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"In Ahmedabad, the Jin Aagna Yuva Group arranges auto-ric